WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.233 --> 00:00:16.300
"Is kidding?"

2
00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:18.261
Zann thought in disbelief.

3
00:00:18.281 --> 00:00:21.783
"Perda and I don't want to be part of her little power club.

4
00:00:22.403 --> 00:00:25.866
Especially since we were just about to show everyone what a fraud she is!"

5
00:00:26.646 --> 00:00:28.127
He opened his mouth to say so.

6
00:00:28.627 --> 00:00:29.788
But Perda elbowed him.

7
00:00:30.424 --> 00:00:34.287
"Thank you for your kind offer, Zira," she said.

8
00:00:34.307 --> 00:00:38.931
"Please allow us to take a moment and discuss whether we should accept."

9
00:00:38.951 --> 00:00:41.013
"Of course."

10
00:00:41.693 --> 00:00:45.456
Zira sounded slightly displeased, though she continued to smile.

11
00:00:45.476 --> 00:00:51.081
"But first, as a demonstration of good faith, I'll remove your Shackles."

12
00:00:52.042 --> 00:00:56.065
She snapped her fingers, and the Shackles disappeared from Perda's wrists and legs.

13
00:00:56.085 --> 00:00:59.508
"Thank you," Perda said, rubbing her wrists.

14
00:01:00.264 --> 00:01:02.405
She headed outside, and Zann followed.

15
00:01:02.425 --> 00:01:05.467
"Did you say that just so she'd Unshackle you?"

16
00:01:05.987 --> 00:01:09.389
Zann asked, a little confused by the way Perda was behaving.

17
00:01:09.409 --> 00:01:13.051
"Because we definitely don't want to be in the inner circle!"

18
00:01:13.071 --> 00:01:17.093
"Of course we don't," Perda said, looking sly.

19
00:01:17.113 --> 00:01:20.115
"But I think we should pretend that we do.

20
00:01:20.955 --> 00:01:25.198
That way, maybe we can figure out what Zira's plans are for Terrica.

21
00:01:25.978 --> 00:01:28.519
Then we'll know whether it's safe to leave Mellis here.

22
00:01:29.772 --> 00:01:35.315
Plus, if Zira thinks we're on her side, she'll probably allow us to free Zing."

23
00:01:36.236 --> 00:01:37.397
Zann thought about that.

24
00:01:37.997 --> 00:01:41.399
He wanted his dragon back, and he wanted to get back to Magica.

25
00:01:41.899 --> 00:01:44.141
He also wanted to make sure Mellis was safe.

26
00:01:44.961 --> 00:01:48.003
As usual, Perda had concocted a clever plan.

27
00:01:48.023 --> 00:01:51.125
"I suppose you're right," he said.

28
00:01:51.145 --> 00:01:56.308
"Also, if we're in the inner circle, we might be able to get access to the original wormhole.

29
00:01:56.936 --> 00:01:59.998
Then we won't have to zap all the way to the other wormhole near the mines."

30
00:02:00.958 --> 00:02:01.959
They went back inside.

31
00:02:01.979 --> 00:02:05.621
"Thank you, Zira," Perda said with a bow.

32
00:02:05.641 --> 00:02:11.004
"We accept your very generous offer to join your inner circle."

33
00:02:11.024 --> 00:02:13.605
"Wonderful!" Zira said.

34
00:02:14.666 --> 00:02:16.507
Vilkor looked less enthusiastic.

35
00:02:16.527 --> 00:02:23.291
"If you keep letting people in, soon everyone in Terrica will be part of the inner circle," he

36
00:02:23.351 --> 00:02:25.212
grumbled. Perda ignored him.

37
00:02:25.768 --> 00:02:27.849
"May we say hello to Mellis now?"

38
00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:29.490
she asked politely.

39
00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:31.311
Zann stepped forward.

40
00:02:31.331 --> 00:02:33.232
"We also want to see Zing."

41
00:02:33.952 --> 00:02:37.634
When all the adults looked confused, he added, "The dragon."

42
00:02:37.654 --> 00:02:39.776
"Oh, yes, of course."

43
00:02:40.736 --> 00:02:42.177
Zira signaled to the goons.

44
00:02:42.197 --> 00:02:46.119
"Bring Mellis out at once and release the dragon."

45
00:02:46.139 --> 00:02:48.280
"Are you sure?"

46
00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:50.441
One of the goons looked scared.

47
00:02:51.122 --> 00:02:55.384
"That ungrateful little beast almost burned my hand off when I fed him this morning!"

48
00:02:55.988 --> 00:02:57.889
"You heard me," Zira snapped.

49
00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:00.651
"Go!" The goons hurried off.

50
00:03:01.432 --> 00:03:03.593
Moments later Mellis stepped into the room.

51
00:03:04.254 --> 00:03:05.995
Zann and Perda rushed to greet her.

52
00:03:06.015 --> 00:03:07.496
"You're here!"

53
00:03:08.177 --> 00:03:09.017
Mellis exclaimed.

54
00:03:09.497 --> 00:03:11.139
She looked pale but unharmed.

55
00:03:11.159 --> 00:03:13.560
"I didn't think I'd ever see you two again."

56
00:03:14.381 --> 00:03:15.081
Perda hugged her.

57
00:03:15.101 --> 00:03:17.083
"I'm glad you're safe."

58
00:03:18.384 --> 00:03:20.925
Zann could tell that Perda wanted to say more.

59
00:03:21.626 --> 00:03:27.261
But Zira, Vilkor, and several others were watching them, obviously listening to every word they said.

60
00:03:27.861 --> 00:03:29.022
Zann felt frustrated.

61
00:03:29.562 --> 00:03:33.244
How were they supposed to figure out what to do if they couldn't speak freely?

62
00:03:33.944 --> 00:03:37.765
Meanwhile Perda touched a strand of Mellis' reddish-brown hair.

63
00:03:37.785 --> 00:03:42.167
"Your hair looks so pretty today," she said in a cheerful voice.

64
00:03:42.187 --> 00:03:45.849
"Oh! I figured out a new way to braid my hair yesterday.

65
00:03:45.969 --> 00:03:47.049
I'd love to show you!

66
00:03:47.589 --> 00:03:49.390
Yours would look even prettier that way!"

67
00:03:51.431 --> 00:03:53.092
Zann blinked in surprise.

68
00:03:53.836 --> 00:03:55.817
"What is Perda talking about?"

69
00:03:56.257 --> 00:03:56.657
he thought.

70
00:03:56.677 --> 00:03:59.258
"She didn't braid her hair yesterday."

71
00:03:59.958 --> 00:04:01.278
But Mellis was smiling.

72
00:04:01.298 --> 00:04:03.599
"You're so sweet, Perda!

73
00:04:04.079 --> 00:04:06.020
Your hair is so much prettier than mine!

74
00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:08.200
But I'd love to have you braid it.

75
00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:10.781
I could braid yours, too, so we would match!"

76
00:04:11.541 --> 00:04:12.322
She looked around.

77
00:04:12.342 --> 00:04:16.863
"We could sit right here and do it, and you can tell me all about the different hairstyles

78
00:04:16.883 --> 00:04:17.763
where you come from."

79
00:04:18.904 --> 00:04:19.784
Vilkor laughed.

80
00:04:20.076 --> 00:04:23.638
"Ugh, please don't!"

81
00:04:24.058 --> 00:04:25.019
He waved his hands.

82
00:04:25.039 --> 00:04:28.681
"I can't stand to listen to that sort of silliness."

83
00:04:29.622 --> 00:04:31.122
Zira looked less amused.

84
00:04:31.142 --> 00:04:32.283
"I agree.

85
00:04:32.363 --> 00:04:36.325
The adult members of the inner circle have serious business to discuss.

86
00:04:37.286 --> 00:04:40.168
You three are too young to appreciate it."

87
00:04:40.888 --> 00:04:42.769
Zann opened his mouth to protest.

88
00:04:43.329 --> 00:04:47.412
But a warning look from Perda made him change his mind and shut his mouth.

89
00:04:50.381 --> 00:04:53.604
"Perhaps you're right, Zira," Perda said with a giggle.

90
00:04:53.624 --> 00:04:59.508
"I'm so tired from doing all that magic that I can't think straight!

91
00:05:00.149 --> 00:05:05.153
I'd love to lie down and let Mellis braid my hair, so I don't have to think about

92
00:05:05.333 --> 00:05:07.515
all this grown-up stuff for a while."

93
00:05:07.535 --> 00:05:11.257
"Begone then," Zira said, rolling her eyes.

94
00:05:11.277 --> 00:05:14.160
"You may retire to Mellis' chamber."

95
00:05:14.844 --> 00:05:19.247
Mellis led Zann and Perda to a small room in one of the house's new towers.

96
00:05:20.628 --> 00:05:25.772
Before they entered, Mellis looked around to make sure that no goons were close enough to hear them.

97
00:05:25.792 --> 00:05:31.796
"Perda, that was a good idea to trick Zira into letting us be alone."

98
00:05:32.636 --> 00:05:33.437
Perda smiled.

99
00:05:33.457 --> 00:05:37.500
"Thanks. I'm glad you caught on quickly and helped convince her.

100
00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:41.142
Now tell us what's been going on here since we left."

101
00:05:42.223 --> 00:05:43.384
Zann felt sheepish.

102
00:05:44.008 --> 00:05:47.229
So that was why Perda had been talking and acting so weird!

103
00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:50.271
She was trying to get the three of them some privacy.

104
00:05:50.291 --> 00:05:55.153
"I should have known," he thought, shooting Perda an admiring look.

105
00:05:55.933 --> 00:06:02.055
Whispering, Mellis told Zann and Perda that she'd been trapped in Zira's mansion ever since Perda had zapped

106
00:06:02.115 --> 00:06:07.698
away. This was the first time she'd been allowed to see anyone other than Zira and the goons

107
00:06:07.798 --> 00:06:08.618
guarding her door.

108
00:06:08.638 --> 00:06:13.160
"I was relieved to see Uncle Vilkor out there just now," she said.

109
00:06:13.664 --> 00:06:15.005
"I was worried for his safety.

110
00:06:15.845 --> 00:06:20.247
I don't think Zira intends to share power with anyone, no matter what she says."

111
00:06:21.047 --> 00:06:21.808
Zann nodded.

112
00:06:22.248 --> 00:06:28.311
Before he could say anything, he suddenly felt an intense, searing heat strike his entire body.

113
00:06:28.331 --> 00:06:31.792
"Aaah!" he cried, spinning around.

114
00:06:32.633 --> 00:06:36.194
Suddenly his terror and pain turned to joy.
